# Engine Rules

**Entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · **Standards:** [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) §3.2–3.7 · **Deep dive:** [docs/ai/03-engine.md](../../docs/ai/03-engine.md), [04-actions-and-requests.md](../../docs/ai/04-actions-and-requests.md)

## Scope

`lib/engine/` — interpret `ComponentConfig` trees into widgets; `tap` actions; request mapping.

## Must

- Dispatch by `type` + `props` + `data` — **not** `semanticType` as renderer key
- Implement `ComponentRenderer` for new types; register in `ScreenRenderer._createDefaultRenderers`
- Add schema keys in `component_schemas.dart`
- Resolve display via `dataContext` (`valuePath`, `urlPath`)
- New JSON props: [builder-spec rule](../../RULES.md) §3.4 — grep prod JSON or add `docs/engine/builder-specs/`
- Run `flutter test` before finishing (`test/engine/`)

## Must not

- Import `lib/features/*` in `lib/engine/tree/renderers/`
- Call `ProductRepo` / `AuthRepo` / `Dio` or cubits from renderers
- Fetch list/grid data in renderers — orchestration in `VariantScreen`
- Encode merchant-specific layout or `tenantSlug` branches

## Key files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `screen_renderer/screen_renderer.dart` | Registry (20 types incl. `unsupported`) |
| `actions/action_dispatcher.dart` | `tap`: navigate \| apiCall \| cubitCall |
| `requests/request_mapper.dart` | Collect `data.requestUrl` |
| `request_ui_state.dart` | List/grid loading / empty / error |
| `tree/renderers/*.dart` | Per-type implementations |

